    {
      "id": "2121702076665286825",
      "text": "Also in this notebook: *How Castle and Wembanyama teamed up to hand Warriors rookie Yaxel Lendeborg his worst night as a pro. \"Couldn't make a damn layup,\" he said. *Plus, talked with Devin Vassell upon his first game back from injury. https://t.co/IuWmjJ3aQY via @expressnews",
