    {
      "id": "2121700540103225847",
      "text": "“It’s not surprising.\" Devoid of eyes in the back of his head, Victor Wembanyama did not see Draymond Green's blindside flagrant foul coming. Figuratively? Of course he did. Why roughing up Vic isn't the winning strategy it used to be: https://t.co/IuWmjJ3IGw via @expressnews",
      "url": "https://x.com/JMcDonald_SAEN/status/2121700540103225847",
      "published": "2026-11-14T20:23:22+00:00",
      "likes": 10,
      "author": "Jeff McDonald",
      "handle": "JMcDonald_SAEN",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/971852605390336000/uA0TeMUO_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2121699173846360314",
      "text": "“I think the biggest obstacle I had was really myself.\" Nobody on the Spurs' roster has been as affected by the move to a three-guard backcourt than Stephon Castle. Why the Spurs have hope one of the NBA's most adaptable players will find his new place: https://t.co/uJ06Mtxg8D",
      "url": "https://x.com/JMcDonald_SAEN/status/2121699173846360314",
